# Bankside MOT

Garage marketing site + MOT booking + workshop admin for Bankside MOT & Repair (Falkirk). Live site: https://banksidemot.com.

**Stack:** Astro 7, Cloudflare Workers (`@astrojs/cloudflare`), Tailwind 4, Alpine.js, Postgres via Hyperdrive (SQLite at `data/bookings.db` locally), nodemailer SMTP, Vehicle Smart VRM lookup. Node `>=22.12.0`. No React islands, no Stripe, no D1.

**Split:** Prerender marketing pages. SSR only `/admin/*` and `/api/*`. Domain logic belongs in `src/lib/booking/` — reuse it; do not duplicate booking, auth, slots, or DB access elsewhere.

**Deploy source of truth:** `wrangler.jsonc` (Workers bindings `HYPERDRIVE`, `SESSION` KV). Treat `netlify.toml.legacy` as unused legacy.

**Hard stops:** Never run `scripts/reset-workshop.ts` against production. Never commit secrets or real SMTP/API keys. Do not add online card payments. Read `AGENTS.md` for cold-start commands.
